{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You need the money.</strong> That\u2019s it. There are no laws, morals, or theological ideologies that will change the facts. You must save Mom. Are you willing to sacrifice the needs of these strangers they call your coworkers? They aren\u2019t going to stand by and let you. Are you willing to feed the rot that poisons the world? Maybe taking the job is already doing so. Can you burn it all down? You have to try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/ab7e57eaee2317dfe2cf2253856cd7e5.poster.avif?t=1767926074\" aria-label=\"Master your instruments\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/ab7e57eaee2317dfe2cf2253856cd7e5.webm?t=1767926074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accuracy and precision are both keys to success. Develop expertise in handling your implements to improve your efficiency and avoid mistakes. More accurate, more precise, more commission. However, avoid habits and remain alert. Daily challenges can break your routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/8410a8a9793ab512b6baa23cf9f944a7.poster.avif?t=1767926074\" aria-label=\"6 paned gif showing each of the main instruments while operating\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/8410a8a9793ab512b6baa23cf9f944a7.webm?t=1767926074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/8410a8a9793ab512b6baa23cf9f944a7.mp4?t=1767926074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/0fbce9a17c035c8dc7cd54288f2d8f90.poster.avif?t=1767926074\" aria-label=\"Carve your path\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/0fbce9a17c035c8dc7cd54288f2d8f90.webm?t=1767926074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate with your coworkers at work and family and friends from home. Remember: your interactions with everyone you talk to can dramatically shift the world around you in both future discussions and your work day. Give somebody advice? They might take it in a way that alters their life. Make too much money one day? Someone might get jealous and take desperate action against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/63ff5e41c49ced7dbb69bd6ae1d402ad.poster.avif?t=1767926074\" aria-label=\"text messaging dialogue system showing potential dialogue decision\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/63ff5e41c49ced7dbb69bd6ae1d402ad.webm?t=1767926074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/63ff5e41c49ced7dbb69bd6ae1d402ad.mp4?t=1767926074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchasing upgrades is another excellent way to increase productivity. Many items can lessen your workload, boost your earnings, and make your ingredients easier to keep track of. There are also ways to aesthetically customize your space, so your work environment is as comfortable as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/ce57736b97b0b8a8709d3e853c849f59.poster.avif?t=1767926074\" aria-label=\"Three paned gif of instruments flashing between upgraded and standard\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/ce57736b97b0b8a8709d3e853c849f59.webm?t=1767926074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/ce57736b97b0b8a8709d3e853c849f59.mp4?t=1767926074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/7edd426df646d3b582148a5ea6aba5d3.poster.avif?t=1767926074\" aria-label=\"Unravel the mystery\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/7edd426df646d3b582148a5ea6aba5d3.webm?t=1767926074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every company has a skeleton in the closet. With Max Potency, however, the term &quot;Corporate Hell&quot; may not be as metaphorical as it seems. Choose if you will take what you need and get out, or if you will risk everything to help make them pay.</p><p 